{"id":"n25378-1-11","stage":4,"title":"걷어차다 · 踹","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25378-1-11-1","ko":"한여름에 웬 감기에 다 걸렸니?","zh":"大热天怎么还会感冒啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한여름에","meaning":"盛夏，酷暑","explanation":"한여름：盛夏，酷暑；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한여름","audio":"/audio/1f82eb48400eef9703cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85583","senseId":"1","lemma":"한여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"有个","explanation":"웬：有个","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"2","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감기에","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"连","explanation":"다：连","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"3","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸렸니?","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f82eb48400eef97","term":"한여름","zh":"盛夏，酷暑","audio":"/audio/1f82eb48400eef9703cb.mp3","entryId":"85583","definition":"夏天最炎热的时候。","pronunciation":["한녀름"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"有个","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"某个。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"连","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"表示“出乎意料地”，含有轻微惊讶、感叹、嘲讽等意思。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f8f57e8add382d2ae39.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25378-1-11-2","ko":"내가 자꾸 이불을 걷어차고 자는 바람에 그런 것 같아.","zh":"好像是因为我总踢开被子睡觉才这样的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이불을","meaning":"被子","explanation":"이불：被子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이불","audio":"/audio/069e5687d79ae41e3018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69531","senseId":"1","lemma":"이불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걷어차고","meaning":"踹，蹬","explanation":"걷어차다：踹，蹬；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"걷어차다","audio":"/audio/135f544d229c8533fd3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25378","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷어차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자는","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"表示后句的理由或原因。","explanation":"바람：表示后句的理由或原因。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/au